"一個簡單的前端，用於在銷售點接受 WooCommerce 訂單。需要 <a href=\"http://wordpress.org/plugins/woocommerce/\">WooCommerce</a>。"

#. Author of the plugin
msgid "kilbot"
msgstr "kilbot"

#. Author URI of the plugin
msgid "http://wcpos.com"
msgstr "http://wcpos.com"

